Kanna (神山 カンナ Kamiyama Kanna) is the treasurer of the Student Council who is seen frequently in the company of her friends in the Student Council, including the President and Vice President.

Kanna has dirty blonde hair and wolf ears with a tail. She typically wears the magic academy uniform.
Personality

Kanna is shown to be very positive and loyal to her friends in the student council.
