Michie Otake (Michie Ōtake) is the Student Council Vice President of Constant Magic Academy.

Michie is moderately tall and slim. She wears a Constant Magic Academy uniform and is frequently seen wearing a long black-and-red cape. She has dark red eyes and pink hair tied in two pigtails with purple ribbons.
Personality

Michie is silent and deferential. She occasionally uses different Japanese dialects when she speaks, sometimes several within the same sentence, which some of the other characters have observed or commented on.

Abilities

Magic - Michie uses magic to control a large swarm of bats, and is seen using it on several occasions in battle and as rapid transportation.
